# ===================
# User data (runtime storage - DO NOT DELETE)
# Anchored to the repo root (leading /) so these only match the real
# runtime user-data directories there — an unanchored pattern like `users/`
# also matched source directories of the same name anywhere in the repo
# (e.g. kawamonn-storage-backend/src/users/, the Android app's
# java/com/kawamonn/ package), silently excluding real source files from git.
# ===================
/users/
/kawamonn/
/katsumi/
/toya/
/admin_kawamonn/
/myproject/

# kawamonn-labs is its own independent git repository, not tracked here.
/kawamonn-labs/

# 過去のソース一式のスナップショット(古く不正確な運用資料を含む)。公開リポジトリには載せない
/Kawamonn_Project.zip
# 内部構成(トンネル・VPN・ホストのパス等)を含む手元用の解説資料。公開リポジトリには載せない
